// Batch 30: the card library, written once here and printed as data/library/cards.json
// (node tools/library/cards-source.mjs > data/library/cards.json). Each card says where it was checked and how:
//   verified 'issuer'     the issuer's own page (or its press release) was read on the checked date
//   verified 'secondary'  a review site that quotes the issuer, read on the checked date (the issuer page would not load)
//   verified 'unverified' from what was known in mid 2026, not re-read tonight; unverified lists the parts to check
// The rewards say how many points (or cents) a dollar earns in each category; pointValue is the dollars one point is
// worth in SLAM's math (the cash or travel-portal floor, never a transfer-partner best case).
// A benefit is words for the coach and client; only credits carry a dollar value a year.
